# MIRSAD local LLM: Qwen3 8B (Q4_K_M, ~4.9 GB) with an 8k context for the investigation agent.
# Measured on an RTX 4060 Laptop (8 GB): at 8k context everything stays in VRAM (prompt 1744 tok/s, generation
# 36 tok/s); at 12k+ the KV cache spills to shared system memory (prompt 209 tok/s). Run the Ollama server with
# OLLAMA_FLASH_ATTENTION=1 and OLLAMA_KV_CACHE_TYPE=q8_0. Investigations are kept under ~7.5k tokens (loop.py guard).
FROM qwen3:8b
PARAMETER num_ctx 8192
PARAMETER temperature 0
